{"id":"n64002-4-10","stage":1,"title":"강하다 · 抗","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64002-4-10-1","ko":"승규는 연습 때에는 못하는 것 같은데 진짜 경기에서는 제일 잘해.","zh":"承奎在练习的时候好像表现不佳，但一到正式比赛却表现得最好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}},{"text":"연습","meaning":"练习","explanation":"연습：练习","readings":[{"term":"연습","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92041","senseId":"1","lemma":"연습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연습","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3"}},{"text":"때에는","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때에는","audio":"/audio/242af32f582a9e2ff71b.mp3"}},{"text":"못하는","meaning":"不会","explanation":"못하다：不会；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못하는","audio":"/audio/2b1fcda8d4b9e7cc9e1b.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading